contentText:
Karol G is ready to elevate her influence, stepping boldly into the spotlight as Reebok’s new global brand ambassador, Billboard can exclusively announce Wednesday (Jan. 21).

Marking a new era for the footwear brand, the multi-year partnership marks the return of the Reebok Classics sneaker with Karol G at the forefront of its storytelling, creative content and upcoming global activations, most notably for its campaign &#8220;Born Classic. Worn for Life.&#8221;

